  "details": "When you switch from global to one handed (like when a controller disconnect/loose tracking) while pressing input (like walking/rotating), this action is done undefinitively until the disconnected controller comes back to life.\n\nFor example, if you are walking forward and suddently one of your controller disconnect, you will continue to move forward until the disconnected controller is reconnected.\n\nhttps://youtu.be/wsZpla5t5dU\n\nThis doesn't seem to be an issue when switching from one handed to globlal",
